WEBVTT

00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:13,460
How important is the grounding that in conjunction with the rife treatments?

00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:19,300
So the grounding that comes with your rife machine is to be used,

00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:27,460
when you use the iron pro wave. So iron pro wave, everybody thinks it's just to pull

00:00:27,460 --> 00:00:33,860
junk out of your body through your feet. No, it's to get different frequencies in your body and

00:00:33,860 --> 00:00:39,860
doing so it does have an avenue of escape for different things as well. So but the purpose of that

00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:44,820
is to pull the frequencies into your body and you do want to put the grounding mat behind your

00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:51,300
back when you're doing iron pro wave. That's only time you're used to the grounding mat. If you have

00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:59,060
a different grounding mat at home or a grounding sheet at home, as I have said in so many of the

00:00:59,060 --> 00:01:06,820
videos, the grounding sheet should be used on the lower half of your bed underneath the fitted

00:01:06,820 --> 00:01:14,980
mattress, fitted sheet, the lower half of your bed underneath the fitted sheet.

